{"seq":1,"slug":"append-only-worm","title":"只追加与 WORM 存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-audit-log-platform/tamper-proof-storage/append-only-worm","wordCount":3421,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"只追加与-worm-存储\">只追加与 WORM 存储</h1><p>审计表最常见的实现灾难是这样发生的：团队建了一张 <code>audit_log</code> 表，写入正常，查询正常，跑了两年。然后一次内部调查需要确认某条记录是否被动过，DBA 查了一下说这条记录的 <code>updated_at</code> 字段显示它是上周被改的——但审计记录本来不应该有 <code>updated_at</code> 字段，因为审计记录不该被更新。再一查，是三个月前一次「数据修正」脚本批量更新了几千条记录，理由是「当时有个字段写错了要回填」。没有人认为这有什么问题，因为在他们看来审计表只是一张普通表。</p>\n<p>这就是为什么「不可篡改」必须是<strong>数据模型层面的属性</strong>而不是<strong>流程层面的承诺</strong>。流程层面的承诺（「我们规定不许改」）在任何一次赶工期、任何一次误操作、任何一个有权限的人面前都会失效。数据模型层面的属性（「这个存储不提供 UPDATE 这个操作」）则是在结构上不可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-只追加的语义层次\">核心概念：只追加的语义层次</h2><h3 id=\"四个保证层级\">四个保证层级</h3><p>append-only 不是一个是非题，而是有层次的。理解这些层次，才能判断自己手上的存储到底提供了哪一层的保证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[append-only 保证层级] --&gt; L1[L1 应用约定]&#10;  A --&gt; L2[L2 权限约束]&#10;  A --&gt; L3[L3 存储引擎不支持更新]&#10;  A --&gt; L4[L4 硬件级 WORM]&#10;  L1 --&gt; L1a[最弱: 靠代码不写 UPDATE]&#10;  L2 --&gt; L2a[中等: 数据库账号无 UPDATE 权限]&#10;  L3 --&gt; L3a[较强: LSM/SST 或只追加段文件]&#10;  L4 --&gt; L4a[最强: 介质不可改写 由云端/硬件强制]\">graph TD\n  A[append-only 保证层级] --&gt; L1[L1 应用约定]\n  A --&gt; L2[L2 权限约束]\n  A --&gt; L3[L3 存储引擎不支持更新]\n  A --&gt; L4[L4 硬件级 WORM]\n  L1 --&gt; L1a[最弱: 靠代码不写 UPDATE]\n  L2 --&gt; L2a[中等: 数据库账号无 UPDATE 权限]\n  L3 --&gt; L3a[较强: LSM/SST 或只追加段文件]\n  L4 --&gt; L4a[最强: 介质不可改写 由云端/硬件强制]</pre><h3 id=\"l1-与-l2-约定与权限约束\">L1 与 L2：约定与权限约束</h3><p><strong>L1 应用约定</strong>：代码里不写 <code>UPDATE</code> 语句。这是最常见的做法，也是几乎为零的保证——一个直连数据库的运维、一次误执行的脚本、一个带 <code>ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE</code> 的 upsert 都能绕过它。</p>\n<p><strong>L2 权限约束</strong>：给写入审计的数据库账号只授予 <code>INSERT</code>，撤销 <code>UPDATE</code> 与 <code>DELETE</code>。这一层是低成本高回报的，应当始终开启。它的局限是它保护不了拥有更高权限的账号（DBA、云平台的 root），也保护不了存储层本身的操作（直接改数据文件）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"l3-与-l4-存储引擎与介质\">L3 与 L4：存储引擎与介质</h3><p><strong>L3 存储引擎不支持更新</strong>：选择那些在引擎层面就没有原地更新的存储——只追加的段文件（segment file）、LSM 树的 SST 文件、分区按时间切分的不可变文件集。写入的形态是「追加一个新文件或一个新段」，旧文件一旦封口就不再被触碰。这一层把「不修改」变成了「没有修改的路径」，比权限约束更强，因为它不依赖于「权限有没有配错」。</p>\n<p><strong>L4 硬件级 WORM</strong>：存储介质或云服务在物理上拒绝在保留期内改写或删除对象，且这种拒绝无法被任何 API、任何账号（包括云厂商的根账号）绕过。这一层是唯一能被监管无条件采信的，也是本章后面要展开的重点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"l2-的落地形态-只追加审计表-ddl\">L2 的落地形态：只追加审计表 DDL</h3><p>L2 听起来是一句「撤销 UPDATE 权限」，但真正让它在结构上成立的是一张按时间分区、且没有任何更新入口的表。下面这段 DDL 展示了一个可行的形态：分区键是时间，写入只能落进新分区，历史分区在封口后可以整体转入只读介质。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 审计事件主表：按天分区，只追加&#10;CREATE TABLE audit_event (&#10;    event_id        TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;    event_time      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;    ingest_time     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;    schema_version  TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;    actor_id        TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;    actor_type      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;    on_behalf_of    TEXT,&#10;    action          TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;    outcome         TEXT        NOT NULL CHECK (outcome IN (&#39;success&#39;,&#39;failure&#39;,&#39;denied&#39;,&#39;partial&#39;)),&#10;    target_type     TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;    target_ids      JSONB       NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;[]&#39;::jsonb,&#10;    target_ids_hash TEXT,&#10;    region          TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;    data_category   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;    retention_until TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;    payload         JSONB       NOT NULL,&#10;    chain_hash      BYTEA       NOT NULL,&#10;    prev_chain_hash BYTEA       NOT NULL,&#10;    PRIMARY KEY (event_time, event_id)&#10;) PARTITION BY RANGE (event_time);&#10;&#10;-- 分区按天创建，写入只发生在当天分区与未来分区&#10;CREATE TABLE audit_event_20260927 PARTITION OF audit_event&#10;    FOR VALUES FROM (&#39;2026-09-27&#39;) TO (&#39;2026-09-28&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 写入账号：只有 INSERT 与 SELECT，没有任何更新或删除路径&#10;CREATE ROLE audit_writer LOGIN;&#10;GRANT INSERT, SELECT ON audit_event TO audit_writer;&#10;REVOKE UPDATE, DELETE, TRUNCATE ON audit_event FROM audit_writer;&#10;&#10;-- 表级触发器：任何 UPDATE/DELETE 在进入存储引擎前即被拒绝&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION reject_audit_mutation() RETURNS trigger AS $$&#10;BEGIN&#10;    RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;audit_event is append-only: % is not permitted&#39;, TG_OP;&#10;END;&#10;$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;&#10;&#10;CREATE TRIGGER audit_event_no_update&#10;    BEFORE UPDATE OR DELETE ON audit_event&#10;    FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION reject_audit_mutation();&#10;&#10;-- 分区封口：历史分区转为只读，阻止后续任何写入&#10;ALTER TABLE audit_event_20260926 SET (autovacuum_enabled = off);&#10;REVOKE INSERT ON audit_event_20260926 FROM audit_writer;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 审计事件主表：按天分区，只追加</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> audit_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_time      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ingest_time     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    schema_version  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    actor_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    actor_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    on_behalf_of    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    outcome         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'success'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'failure'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'denied'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'partial'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target_ids      JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '[]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target_ids_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    region          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data_category   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retention_until </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    payload         JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    chain_hash      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BYTEA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev_chain_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BYTEA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event_time, event_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RANGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event_time);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分区按天创建，写入只发生在当天分区与未来分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> audit_event_20260927</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF audit_event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-09-27'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-09-28'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 写入账号：只有 INSERT 与 SELECT，没有任何更新或删除路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ROLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audit_writer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LOGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GRANT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INSERT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audit_event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audit_writer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REVOKE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TRUNCATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audit_event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audit_writer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 表级触发器：任何 UPDATE/DELETE 在进入存储引擎前即被拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reject_audit_mutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trigger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RAISE EXCEPTION </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'audit_event is append-only: % is not permitted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, TG_OP;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plpgsql;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TRIGGER</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> audit_event_no_update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    BEFORE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audit_event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EACH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXECUTE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reject_audit_mutation();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分区封口：历史分区转为只读，阻止后续任何写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audit_event_20260926 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (autovacuum_enabled </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> off</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REVOKE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INSERT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audit_event_20260926 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audit_writer;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段 DDL 的每一部分都对应前面的一个层次。<code>REVOKE UPDATE, DELETE</code> 是 L2 的权限约束；触发器是 L2 的加固——它挡住了「权限配错」这一种失败模式，因为即使有人误授了权限，触发器仍然拒绝；把封口分区的 <code>INSERT</code> 也撤销，则让历史分区在数据库层面也不再有写入路径，接近 L3 的语义。真实系统里这些历史分区通常会进一步导出为不可变对象并落入对象存储，由下一节的 WORM 配置接管。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三层叠加的工程取向\">三层叠加的工程取向</h3><p>一个成熟的设计通常同时占据 L2 与 L3，并在最关键的审计数据上启用 L4。三层叠加的理由是：L2 防误操作，L3 防有意的存储层改动，L4 防连平台自己都无法抵赖的争议——它同时也是「我们连自己都改不了」这句话能被写进合规材料的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对象存储的合规保留模型\">对象存储的合规保留模型</h2><h3 id=\"三个概念-对象锁-保留期-法律保全\">三个概念：对象锁、保留期、法律保全</h3><p>云对象存储提供的不可变能力围绕三个概念展开，理解它们的交互是正确配置的前提。</p>\n<p>**对象锁（Object Lock）**是一个桶级或对象级的开关，开启后该对象的保留设置才生效。AWS S3 的 Object Lock 必须在创建桶时启用，之后不能关闭——这个不可逆性本身就是设计意图的一部分。</p>\n<p>**保留期（Retention Period）**指定一个到期时间。在此之前对象不能被覆盖或删除。</p>\n<p><strong>法律保全（Legal Hold）<strong>是一个独立于保留期的标志位。置位后对象不能被删除，且它</strong>没有到期时间</strong>——只有显式解除才会放开。它与保留期的关系是「或」：任一条件限制删除，删除就被禁止。法律保全的用途是诉讼或调查期间，需要在正常保留期之外继续锁定特定对象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"governance-与-compliance-的取舍\">Governance 与 Compliance 的取舍</h3><p>保留模式是这里最关键的选择。AWS S3 提供两种：<strong>Governance 模式</strong>允许拥有特定 IAM 权限的用户提前删除或缩短保留期；<strong>Compliance 模式</strong>不允许任何人提前删除或缩短保留期，包括桶的所有者和 AWS 根账号。Google Cloud Storage 的 Bucket Lock 在语义上接近 Compliance 模式——一旦设置保留策略并锁定，策略只能延长不能缩短，对象在保留期内不可删除。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>Governance 模式</th>\n<th>Compliance 模式</th>\n<th>GCS Bucket Lock</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提前删除对象</td>\n<td>有权限者可</td>\n<td>任何账号都不可以</td>\n<td>任何账号都不可以（锁定期内）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩短保留期</td>\n<td>有权限者可</td>\n<td>不可以</td>\n<td>不可以（只能延长）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否关闭该特性</td>\n<td>可</td>\n<td>不可</td>\n<td>不可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管采信度</td>\n<td>中（依赖权限控制）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维灵活性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"l4-的落地形态-桶级-object-lock-与一条写入策略\">L4 的落地形态：桶级 Object Lock 与一条写入策略</h3><p>L4 的配置不是「打开一个开关」，而是三件必须同时成立的事：桶启用对象锁、写入时带上保留期、且写入方没有缩短保留期的权限。下面是一份可直接照抄的配置与随附的桶策略，它把「运维账号也不能提前删除」这条性质固定下来。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;bucket&quot;: &quot;audit-events-eu&quot;,&#10;  &quot;object_lock&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;enabled&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;default_retention&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;COMPLIANCE&quot;,&#10;      &quot;days&quot;: 2555,&#10;      &quot;comment&quot;: &quot;7 年——实际天数必须以该数据类别在本区域的法定下限为准&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;legal_hold_supported&quot;: true&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;lifecycle&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;seal-to-archive&quot;,&#10;      &quot;filter&quot;: { &quot;prefix&quot;: &quot;sealed/&quot; },&#10;      &quot;transitions&quot;: [&#10;        { &quot;days&quot;: 90, &quot;storage_class&quot;: &quot;GLACIER_IR&quot; },&#10;        { &quot;days&quot;: 400, &quot;storage_class&quot;: &quot;DEEP_ARCHIVE&quot; }&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;expiration&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;expired_object_delete_marker&quot;: true,&#10;        &quot;days_after_retention&quot;: 30,&#10;        &quot;comment&quot;: &quot;保留期到期后留 30 天宽限期供合规复核&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;versioning&quot;: { &quot;status&quot;: &quot;Enabled&quot; },&#10;  &quot;encryption&quot;: { &quot;sse&quot;: &quot;aws:kms&quot;, &quot;bucket_key_enabled&quot;: true }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"audit-events-eu\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"object_lock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"default_retention\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"COMPLIANCE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2555</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"comment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7 年——实际天数必须以该数据类别在本区域的法定下限为准\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"legal_hold_supported\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lifecycle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seal-to-archive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"prefix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sealed/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"transitions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"storage_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GLACIER_IR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"storage_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DEEP_ARCHIVE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"expiration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"expired_object_delete_marker\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"days_after_retention\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"comment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"保留期到期后留 30 天宽限期供合规复核\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"versioning\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-d